  "display_title": "The Fitness Villainess",
  "description": "Being reincarnated into your favorite game isn’t so bad, but what if you’re now the main villainess who is destined to die from bad health in almost every ending? After spending her past life in a hospital, Aslan is determined to make her new body healthy, even if she has to become a fitness fanatic… After she conquers that, she’ll work on an important aspect of surviving the game—her likability. However, can she succeed when everyone expects her to be a villainess? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
